WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.280
Inflation rises – and gold falls? There's a reason.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:10.080
The CPI measures how fast prices in the US are rising.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:14.720
Step one: What matters is the difference from the forecast.

00:00:14.770 --> 00:00:20.910
Step two: Higher than expected often means higher rates. Gold falls.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.760
Step three: Mark the date. No new trades before the number.

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:32.360
Common mistake: inflation up, so gold up. Short term, interest rates matter.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:37.110
I show news trades live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
